\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Come, let us join our cheerful songs
\par With angels round the throne,
\par Ten thousand thousand are their tongues,
\par But all their joys are one.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Worthy the Lamb that died, they cry, 
\par To be exalted thus;
\par Worthy the Lamb, our hearts reply,
\par For He was slain for us.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Jesus is worthy to receive
\par Honour and power divine;
\par And blessings,more than we can give,
\par Be, Lord, for ever Thine.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. The whole creation join in one
\par To bless the sacred name
\par Of Him that sits upon the throne,
\par And to adore the Lamb. \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

